6.4 Laguerre Polynomials
The following example plots the first four Laguerre polynomials on the same
graph. Code is entered into a script file ‘Laguerre.m’ and executed at the Command
Prompt by typing
>> Laguerre
x=-1.5:.1:5;
L0=laguerreL(0,x);
L1=laguerreL(1,x);
L2=laguerreL(2,x);
L3=laguerreL(3,x);
plot(x,L0,'-k',x,L1,':k',x,L2,'-.k',x,L3,'--k','LineWidth',2)
legend('L0(x)','L1(x)','L2(x)','L3(x)')
xlabel('x')
